PC Streaming (the "PC Streaming" screen and the :moonlight module)
------------------------------------------------------------------
The streaming core is a trimmed copy of Moonlight for Android and its native libraries.
VictorLink64's own screens (discovery, pairing, app list, settings, player, controller
overlay) are original code; the protocol, pairing, video/audio decode and network code
are Moonlight's.

